WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:04.040
The four Emperors are the most powerful characters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:09.520
in all of One Piece. But on top of being&nbsp;
the absolute strongest beings in the world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.920
they also play an important political role in&nbsp;
balancing the powers of the world. So let’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:19.240
break down the complex Emperor system&nbsp;
by discussing its history, its purpose,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:26.640
who each emperor is, and how they all became&nbsp;
so MIND-BLOWINGLY powerful in the first place.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.200
Starting with the fact that just one of&nbsp;
these RIDICULOUSLY STRONG characters is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.520
enough to make the World Government cry like&nbsp;
a little baby. In fact, when just one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:43.400
Emperors attacked Marine HQ they had to call in&nbsp;
EVERY SINGLE ONE of their strongest fighters to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.000
even have a chance to survive. So you might&nbsp;
be asking yourself, “Well Manu, if these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.960
Emperors are so powerful then why haven’t they&nbsp;
already taken out the World Government?” Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:59.000
is an excellent question that I promise we will&nbsp;
answer if you make it to the end of the video.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.200
But first, let’s start with the basics because&nbsp;
in the One Piece World the pirate captains with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:11.000
the most influence and power are typically&nbsp;
called Emperors of the Sea. At the start of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.840
the story there were four Emperors, who we’ll&nbsp;
talk more about in just a moment. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:23.000
honestly the Emperor system isn’t really an&nbsp;
official organization where the pirates get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:27.680
together and figure out the strongest&nbsp;
fighters. Instead, it is mostly based&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:35.560
on who the world views as the strongest and most&nbsp;
important pirates. Which isn’t a perfect system,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:38.200
and can lead to some HILARIOUS MISTAKES,&nbsp;
as we’ll talk about in just a few minutes.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:44.920
Now we have to keep in mind that these Emperors&nbsp;
are ridiculously powerful on their own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:50.000
it usually isn’t enough to just be a ridiculously&nbsp;
powerful fighter on your own. Because what really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.720
puts a character at Emperor Tier is the fact&nbsp;
that they have a ton of super strong allies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:02.040
and usually rule over important territories&nbsp;
in the most dangerous part of the sea, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:08.400
New World. And we’ll talk about the structure of&nbsp;
each of the Emperors’ crews later on, but before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:13.360
that it is super important to understand&nbsp;
the Emperors’ true purpose in the story.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:17.240
Because what you might not know is that&nbsp;
although most of the Emperors claim to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:23.480
be going after the One Piece treasure, their&nbsp;
actual main purpose in the story is basically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:29.560
to be an obstacle to stop any of the younger&nbsp;
pirates trying to find the One Piece. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:33.920
they are able to do this because in order to&nbsp;
find the legendary final island, Laugh Tale,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:42.280
you need the four of these unbreakable red stones&nbsp;
which will guide you to Laugh Tale. And at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:47.400
start of the story, two of these red stones&nbsp;
were held by the Emperor’s Kaido and Big Mom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:51.680
which means they are somewhat close to finding&nbsp;
the one piece, although they don’t seem to have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:57.560
made any progress for decades. That might&nbsp;
be because they rarely come into conflict&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:02.880
with each other because if two Emperors were to&nbsp;
actually go all out and fight, it would leave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:09.040
both of them extremely weak and vulnerable to&nbsp;
attack from a third Emperor or even the Marines.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:14.880
So yeah, if you are a young pirate good luck&nbsp;
trying to take out one of these monstrous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.880
fighters. But this is exactly why there&nbsp;
is basically a stalemate in the New World,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:26.280
where no one is truly making progress&nbsp;
towards the One Piece. I mean the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.800
marines can’t take out the Emperors&nbsp;
without seriously weakening themselves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:35.520
young pirates join or get taken out by the&nbsp;
Emperors, and the Emperors themselves don’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:41.240
really want to fight each other either.&nbsp;
Which sounds kinda boring but you might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:48.680
be surprised to learn that this is EXACTLY&nbsp;
how the World Government wants it. No one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:54.840
makes it any closer to finding the One Piece or&nbsp;
learning the World Government's darkest secrets.

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:59.760
Now I actually just lied when I said that no one&nbsp;
is making progress towards the One Piece, because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:06.480
if you have been following the story AT ALL then&nbsp;
you know that the main character Luffy is getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:12.040
VERY CLOSE to finding the legendary treasure.&nbsp;
And at this point at the end of the Wano arc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:19.120
Luffy is officially an Emperor of the Sea - for&nbsp;
real this time. Which actually gave us a true&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:24.720
glimpse at how a character becomes an Emperor&nbsp;
because taking down the Emperor Kadio made it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:33.120
so the entire world simply had to recognize&nbsp;
him as one of the strongest pirates around.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:37.280
However, despite what you might think,&nbsp;
defeating one Emperor doesn’t automatically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:42.760
make the victor the new Emperor. Because when&nbsp;
Blackbeard dealt the final blow to the Emperor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:49.520
Whitebeard, he wasn’t automatically given Emperor&nbsp;
status. Instead, Blackbeard also had to wipe out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:54.680
the rest of Whitebeard’s crew during the timeskip&nbsp;
in order to finally be recognized as an Emperor by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.680 --> 00:05:00.880
the entire world. So again, it is a combination&nbsp;
of super impressive feats against the other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:06.600
Emperors as well as global acknowledgment&nbsp;
of a pirate being massively influential.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:10.920
But this system isn’t perfect, because as we&nbsp;
saw when Luffy escaped from Whole Cake Island,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:16.480
he was called an Emperor even though the other&nbsp;
Emperor’s could tell that he wasn’t strong enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:21.760
yet. However, what happened at the end of Wano&nbsp;
was even more hilarious because the newspaper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:26.840
and World Government started calling Buggy&nbsp;
the Clown a new Emperor as well because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.520
the simple fact that they think he is the leader&nbsp;
of a group of marine hunting pirates. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:36.200
in reality he is just the figurehead&nbsp;
and the real power is with these two.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:41.240
So like I said… not a perfect system at all.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:49.040
What may COMPLETELY SHOCK is that the Emperor&nbsp;
system has probably not existed for very long&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:55.560
at all. I mean we don’t know for sure, but when&nbsp;
people talk about the strongest pirates from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.560 --> 00:06:01.320
past, it was usually one or two pirates who were&nbsp;
super strong and were capable of taking over the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:06.080
world. Specifically I’m talking about forty&nbsp;
years ago with the pirate Rocks D. Xebec, who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:12.120
was said to be so strong he almost conquered the&nbsp;
world. And after him it was the pirate King Gol&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:17.000
D. Roger’s era, which makes me think that&nbsp;
the Emperors only really became a thing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:23.240
once Roger started the great pirate era after his&nbsp;
execution twenty-three years ago. Though we don’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:28.360
really know, so it’s possible that before&nbsp;
becoming pirate king Roger was considered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:34.080
an Emperor alongside Whitebeard, Kaido, and&nbsp;
Big Mom, who were all active at the time.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:39.080
And before we talk more specifically about each&nbsp;
of these LEGENDARY PIRATES, it is super important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:45.600
to discuss the actual structure of the Emperors’&nbsp;
crews. Because as I said these crews are massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:53.560
and most Emperors have multiple islands under&nbsp;
their control. In general, each Emperor will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.560 --> 00:07:00.200
have a group of INSANELY POWERFUL top commanders&nbsp;
right below them, though this varies with each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:06.600
Emperor. For example, Kaido has three All-Star&nbsp;
commanders while Shanks has a larger group of nine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:12.560
Senior Officers. These commander-level crewmates&nbsp;
are usually incredibly powerful on their own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:18.160
with each one easily capable of wiping&nbsp;
out entire pirate crews on their own.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:24.160
Now besides their main crew, each Emperor&nbsp;
typically has allied captains that will come to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:31.200
fight at their command. This was perfectly shown&nbsp;
in Marineford when Whitebeard’s FORTY-THREE allied&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:37.240
captains came to fight for him. But even one of&nbsp;
the newer Emperors like Blackbeard has allied&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:43.600
pirates working under him, like we saw with this&nbsp;
guy right here. Then of course Luffy has the Straw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:48.880
Hat Grand Fleet, who are pirates captains who&nbsp;
pledged to come fight for him when he needs help.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:54.640
And on top of all the strong subordinates, the&nbsp;
Emperor’s usually control one or more islands who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.640 --> 00:08:01.360
are under their protection. For example, Big Mom&nbsp;
has a whole territory of thirty-five islands which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:08.200
make up her dream paradise Tott Land. Then we have&nbsp;
Kaido who of course has taken over Wano Country,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:13.520
but we have also seen he has control of other&nbsp;
random islands. And since these territories&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:19.120
are under the protection of the Emperor, anyone&nbsp;
who attacks them risks becoming a target of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:24.360
Emperor’s crew. We saw this during the Fishman&nbsp;
Island arc, which at the time was under Big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:29.800
Mom’s control, and Luffy’s actions there&nbsp;
made Big Mom instantly label him an enemy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:34.960
On the other hand we have characters like this&nbsp;
guy who ransacked one of Shanks’ territories,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:40.720
and we then later saw Shanks and his crew talking&nbsp;
about getting revenge on this crew. Which at this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:46.280
point you should know that things are probably&nbsp;
going to end very badly for this ragtag bunch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:51.080
of Luffy supporters. But you can avoid the same&nbsp;
tragic fate and get on all the Emperors’ good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:56.520
sides by clicking that nice red subscribe button&nbsp;
to get more one piece content just like this.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:04.120
Now we cannot talk any more about the Emperors&nbsp;
without discussing the SINGLE BIGGEST CLASH of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:10.560
Emperor-level characters in the entire story.&nbsp;
Of course, I’m talking about the conflict at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:17.160
the mysterious island God Valley which happened&nbsp;
forty years ago. And honestly if I had to guess,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:22.960
this is very likely the birthplace of the&nbsp;
modern Emperor system. Because without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:27.840
getting into too many details we had&nbsp;
the legendary Rocks D. Xebec who was the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:33.120
strongest pirate of his era clashing with&nbsp;
the future pirate king, Gol D. Roger. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:37.880
while we don’t know if Roger or Rocks were&nbsp;
ever officially called Emperors of the Sea,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:44.200
I simply had to bring this up because once&nbsp;
Rocks was defeated, his crew separated to form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:51.240
their own pirate crews. And WOW this completely&nbsp;
changed the world because this group had three&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:59.320
future Emperors including Big Mom, Kaido, AND&nbsp;
Whitebeard. Seriously what an INSANE pirate crew.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:05.400
And this is the origin of the future World’s&nbsp;
Strongest man, because after this Whitebeard later&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:11.440
went on to be Roger’s greatest rival. But honestly&nbsp;
Whitebeard was the best kind of pirate. Sure he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:15.720
still stole treasure and smacked down smaller&nbsp;
pirate crews, Whitebeard beats the Spade pirates,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:22.720
but his true dream was just to have a family of&nbsp;
his own. Which is exactly what ended up happening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:28.440
because his entire massive crew were basically&nbsp;
like his sons and daughters. Which means he would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:35.320
do ANYTHING FOR THEM, including enter an all out&nbsp;
war with the marines, just like we saw during the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:41.520
war at Marineford. Which is still to this day the&nbsp;
most insane war arc I have ever seen, and it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:47.600
so epic in large part because Whitebeard is so&nbsp;
stupidly powerful with his Tremor devil fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:52.800
which can literally destroy entire islands.&nbsp;
But Whitebeard wasn’t alone because he also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:58.360
had his super-sized crew led by the sixteen&nbsp;
division commanders PLUS Forty-Three allied&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:04.200
pirate captains. So clearly he was a beloved&nbsp;
captain who was respected by his crew, allies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:09.720
and even older marines like Luffy’s Grandpa,&nbsp;
Garp, and the former Fleet Admiral, Sengoku.

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:15.960
It is also INCREDIBLY IMPORTANT to understand&nbsp;
that each of the Emperors also help us understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:21.320
Luffy’s growing strength on his way to become&nbsp;
pirate king. For example, when Luffy met&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:27.000
Whitebeard, he was nowhere near strong enough to&nbsp;
take out the elderly Emperor, but he was able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:32.680
earn Whitebeard’s respect which played a huge role&nbsp;
when the Emperor’s crew helped Luffy later on.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:37.640
Which makes it completely mind-blowing that we&nbsp;
can have well respected Emperors like Whitebeard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:43.200
but then have straight up evil Emperors like&nbsp;
Kaido. And as we see all throughout the Wano arc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:50.280
this man is power hungry and battle crazy.&nbsp;
In fact, it is his dream to die a spectacular&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:56.440
death just like his former Captain Rocks or even&nbsp;
Whitebeard. But this man takes this wish WAY TOO&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:02.560
FAR because he would literally destroy the entire&nbsp;
world just to find a strong fighter to satisfy his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:10.200
insane wish. And the worst part is that he could&nbsp;
probably do it because he is just stupidly strong.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:17.120
Even in his base form he was powerful enough&nbsp;
to join Rocks’ crew as a teenager AND THEN he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:22.080
got his legendary devil fruit which gives him&nbsp;
the powers of a mythical dragon. But if that’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:29.000
not enough he also has some of the STRONGEST haki&nbsp;
that we have seen in the entire story. Seriously,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:33.520
sometimes I STILL WONDER how Luffy was&nbsp;
able to beat this guy. And in fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:38.880
it was by beating Kaido that Luffy truly&nbsp;
became one of the Emperors of the Sea,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:44.200
which we’ll talk more about in just a moment.&nbsp;
But of course Kaido doesn’t fight alone. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:50.000
crew is made up of thousands of random pirates&nbsp;
alongside purely animal zoan devil fruit users.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:55.640
Which includes awesome dinosaur fruits, and&nbsp;
also the super weird smile fruit users which,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:55.640 --> 00:13:00.360
if you’re lucky, give you some random animal&nbsp;
part on your body. However, Kaido’s crew is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:05.840
not the loving family that Whitebeard’s was&nbsp;
because Kaido actively encourages his strongest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:12.200
subordinates to fight in order to take one of the&nbsp;
top three All-Star commander ranks of the crew.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:16.720
What’s even crazier though is that Kaido almost&nbsp;
got his wish of destroying the world when he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:22.840
teamed up with Big Mom during the Wano arc. Now&nbsp;
before this alliance these two actually hated each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:28.480
other for years, but there is no denying that&nbsp;
Big Mom, whose real name is Charlotte Linlin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:36.280
is a monstrous fighter just like Kaido. She was&nbsp;
also a part of the infamous Rocks crew from a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:42.080
young age, but what’s even more impressive is&nbsp;
that she took out an entire village of giants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:48.960
at just five years old. I mean, come on. That’s&nbsp;
just ridiculous. And ever since then she’s had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:54.680
the god-like powers of the soul devil fruit,&nbsp;
which let her take the life-span of people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:55.440 --> 00:14:00.240
and turn objects into living things. Plus,&nbsp;
as we saw during the Whole Cake Island Arc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:05.000
she also has all three forms of haki which&nbsp;
meant that when Luffy snuck in to steal her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:10.440
Road Poneglyph and get his cook back, he could&nbsp;
not seriously fight with her because he just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:16.440
wasn’t strong enough yet. Which meant that Luffy&nbsp;
instead had to defeat her strongest son, Katakuri,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:21.040
in order for the rest of the straw hats to&nbsp;
escape the island. And that’s honestly one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:26.120
of the most interesting things about Big&nbsp;
Mom’s crew, is that it is literally made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:35.760
up of her son’s and daughters. All Eighty-Five&nbsp;
children AND forty three husbands. Sheesh. Big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:42.080
Mom indeed. She’s basically having kids every&nbsp;
year. But does that mean she is constantly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:47.840
pregnant? Uh, actually, I don’t really want to&nbsp;
know. However, it kinda makes sense because ever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:53.440
since Big Mom was abandoned as a child, her true&nbsp;
goal was to create a paradise where all the races&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:58.880
of the world could live together peacefully.&nbsp;
Which she kinda did with Tott Land, except that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:05.480
she was stealing everyone’s souls and anyone&nbsp;
who pissed her off would be killed. So yeah,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:12.040
not exactly paradise, but more like a twisted&nbsp;
version of the free world Luffy wants to bring.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:18.280
However, all three of the Emperors we’ve&nbsp;
discussed so far have been killed or defeated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:23.480
which means they have lost&nbsp;
their status as Emperors.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:28.920
Which takes us to the first of the current Emperor&nbsp;
we are going to discuss who has actually made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:35.720
his own pirate paradise by becoming the ruler of&nbsp;
Pirate Island. This is of course Blackbeard, who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:40.800
became an Emperor during the timeskip by defeating&nbsp;
the remainder of Whitebeard’s crew. And out of any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:48.360
pirate in the entire story, he has caused the MOST&nbsp;
chaos in the entire world by killing Whitebeard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:53.720
breaking world-class criminals out of the prison&nbsp;
to form his ridiculously strong pirate crew,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:53.720 --> 00:16:00.200
and stealing ridiculously powerful devil fruits&nbsp;
to give to himself and the crew. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:05.080
he is THE ONLY PERSON that we know&nbsp;
of to have eaten two devil fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:11.920
including his Darkness fruit and Whitebeard’s old&nbsp;
Tremor fruit. Seriously, this guy is insane. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:18.280
on top of all of this, his dream is to become king&nbsp;
of the world, which means that he is Luffy’s main&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:25.280
rival to become pirate king and these two will&nbsp;
undoubtedly be clashing in the story very soon.

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:31.480
But speaking of Luffy, his path to becoming&nbsp;
Emperor was honestly the most difficult out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:37.520
of anyone. He had to defeat Kaido plus go&nbsp;
through Big Mom during the Wano arc. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:42.960
he did all this to help his friends, which&nbsp;
is the true essence of Luffy’s dream. Yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:47.920
we all know that he wants to be pirate king,&nbsp;
but that is only because he wants freedom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:53.680
for him and his friends. He has achieved&nbsp;
all of this with the help of his god-like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:53.680 --> 00:17:00.000
devil fruit and by learning all three types of&nbsp;
advanced haki. So truly he is worthy of being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:05.240
called an Emperor. Plus of course, he has his&nbsp;
crew which are incredibly strong in their own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:11.240
right and as the Straw Hat Grand Fleet who&nbsp;
will come fight for him when he needs them.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:18.000
Now while you might think this next Emperor is&nbsp;
a joke, I am here to tell you that Emperor Buggy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:23.640
should be taken VERY SERIOUSLY as a threat&nbsp;
to become pirate king. That’s because he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:28.520
recently became an Emperor as the “leader”&nbsp;
of the Cross Guild group which hunts down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:33.000
marines for bounties. But even though&nbsp;
he isn’t individually all that strong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:40.640
he has an incredible amount of influence in the&nbsp;
pirate world. That’s because for whatever reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:46.800
he is always able to inspire pirates to do what&nbsp;
he wants, which includes tricking much stronger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:52.560
pirates to fight for him. And at this point he&nbsp;
has the World's strongest Swordsman and a former&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:59.920
Warlord of the Sea on his side, so yeah Emperor&nbsp;
Buggy is no laughing matter. Honestly though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:04.720
I have no clue if he will be Luffy’s ally or&nbsp;
enemy by the end of the story, but I wouldn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:10.080
be surprised if he is actually considered King&nbsp;
of the Pirates at the very end of the story.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:17.760
Which of course leaves us with Red Hair Shanks,&nbsp;
who in my opinion is the STRONGEST CURRENT&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:23.320
Emperor, and despite being Luffy’s hero from the&nbsp;
start of the story, he could actually end up being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:31.000
a rival to become pirate king. Now we do know&nbsp;
that Shanks became an Emperor only six years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:36.520
but it is only now that Luffy has defeated Kaido&nbsp;
that he is truly starting his pursuit of the One&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:43.720
Piece treasure. Which might have been his dream&nbsp;
all along, and if this is the case then he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:49.600
going to be a MAJOR THREAT because we have been&nbsp;
told by none other than the marines that Shanks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:57.080
has the MOST BALANCED core crew out of any of the&nbsp;
Emperors with high average bounties and ABSOLUTELY&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:04.600
NO weak spots. So yeah, good luck taking out&nbsp;
the Red Hair Pirates. But what’s even crazier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:11.720
is that it is very likely Shanks’ crew will fight&nbsp;
in some way against the straw hat since they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:17.840
very similar roles on the crew such as first&nbsp;
mate, sniper, navigator, musician, and so on.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:23.320
Which means that Shanks and his crew are just&nbsp;
one of the possible end game opponents for Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:30.640
but perhaps the more likely option is not a&nbsp;
pirate at all but instead the ENTIRE Marine and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:36.360
World Government forces. Because there is NO WAY&nbsp;
the POWERHOUSE fighters like the Marine Admirals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:46.960
will just let Luffy find the One Piece and CHANGE&nbsp;
THE WORLD without a fight. And if you want to know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:51.729
exactly all of the INSANE marines from cadets all&nbsp;
the way up to the strongest officers that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:51.729 --> 00:19:57.200
will be sending to stop Luffy, you can watch my&nbsp;
breakdown of the entire Marine System right here.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:02.520
Shanks for watching and I’ll&nbsp;
see you in the next one.

